  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0420_rival_01",
      "hash": "bd7450943d22dea7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，這邊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0420_rival_02",
      "hash": "bd7451943d22e05a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這個房間\\n其實是船長室呢！\\c\\n船長伯伯是一個\\n會傳授[VAR COLOR(0006)]秘術[VAR COLOR(0000)]的名人喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0420_rival_06",
      "hash": "bd744d943d22d98e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……雖說他現在暈船，\\n整個人病懨懨的就是了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0420_rival_03",
      "hash": "bd7452943d22e20d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "在[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳去見船長伯伯之前，\\c\\n不如先讓我來看看\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的寶可夢訓練得如何吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0420_dummy_01",
      "hash": "1f3758630d6ea9a7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 4]"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0420_rival_04",
      "hash": "bd744b943d22d628",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「[VAR TRNAME(0000)]……\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳怎麼會這麼強啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0420_rival_05",
      "hash": "bd744c943d22d7db",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……沒事，我什麼都沒說！\\c\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一定要讓船長伯伯\\n教[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳[VAR COLOR(0006)]秘術[VAR COLOR(0000)]喔！"
    }
  ],
